IMPORTANT NOTES
================================================================================

1. The auction mechanism is a COMPLETELY SEPARATE code path from Hydra.
   The Hydra behavior must remain EXACTLY as before.

2. Bid Interests (MetricRequest/MetricResponse) are REQUIRED for proper
   timestamp-based coordination.

